meikiocr (Rust)

A Rust port of meikiocr (https://github.com/rtr46/meikiocr), Apache-2.0,
by rtr46. Based on upstream commit 52aa607ecdc1038c7bf390f37cd9a8b306e8a08a.
The preprocessing and postprocessing algorithms were adapted from
meikiocr/ocr.py.

Model weights are not part of this repository. They are distributed
separately by rtr46 on Hugging Face under LGPL-3.0.
